      "source_path": "runbooks/database_restart.md",
      "heading_path": "Database Restart Runbook > Restart Steps",
      "text": "1. Notify the on-call channel.\n2. Drain traffic from the node.\n3. Perform the restart.\n4. Verify health checks pass.",
